<view wx:if="{{show}}" class="shade"
  ><view class="dialog"
    ><view class="heading">隐私保护</view
    ><view>拍照需使用定位、相机和相册权限。照片仅保留在本机，不上传云端。</view
    ><button bindtap="contract">查看隐私保护指引</button
    ><view class="actions"
      ><button bindtap="disagree">暂不同意</button
      ><button
        id="chunmo-privacy-agree"
        open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization"
        bindagreeprivacyauthorization="agree"
        class="agree"
      >
        同意并继续
      </button></view
    ></view
  ></view
>
